  H10990/01-- OPR-A397-WH; 40% OF ASSIGNED RADIUS COVERED BY 100% SIDE SCAN SONAR. REMAINING  AREA TOO SHALLOW FOR LAUNCH OPERATIONS. ONE SIDE SCAN SONAR CONTACT MATCHED THE AWOIS DESCRIPTION. DIVERS LD OF 15 FEET (4.76 METERS) IN LAT. 42-22-51.72N, LONG. 70-59-43.96W. DIVERS DESCRIBE  A 45-FOOT VESSEL. EVALUATOR RECOMMENDS DELETING CHARTED DANGEROUS SUNKEN WRECK, PA AND CHARTING A 15 WK AS SURVEYED. NOTE: TWO WRECKS "SEEM TO HAVE SUNK AT MOORING. LIE SIDE BY SIDE. LEAST DEPTH TAKEN ON TALLEST (SOUTHERNMOST)".  (UP 5/25/04, SJV)</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
<Point>
<coordinates>-70.995544,42.381033,0.0</coordinates>
</Point>
