  LNM53/1984(12/27/83)-- 1ST CGD; REFERENCE; WRECKAGE REPORTED. (ENTERED 6/1999 RWD) (NOTE: POSSIBLY COMPLETED BY WHITING). (UP 7/3/03, SJV)</td>
