<td>  H10790/98-- OPR-E346-AHP; 200% SIDE SCAN SONAR LOCATED A SIGNIFICANT CONTACT RESEMBLING A WRECK WITH AN APPARENT HEIGHT OF 2.7 METERS. ECHO-SOUNDER DEVELOPMENT WITH 5-METER LINE SPACING OBTAINED A LD OF 55 FEET (16.9 METERS) IN LAT. 38-47-39.24N, LONG. 76-24-45.64W. CONTACT LOCATED ON A SLOPE WITH SURROUNDING DEPTHS OF 58-64 FEET. NO DIVE OPS CONDUCTED.  EVALUATOR RECOMMENDSED CHARTING A 55 WK AS SURVEYED. (ENT 6/28/99, SJV)</td>
