  CL597/90-- USPS INVESTIGATION, 4/17/90,  A WRECK, ESTIMATED LENGTH OF 48 FT.,  FOUND AT 24-34.40, 81-50.75 ON A SAND BAR NEAR NW CHANNEL DAYBEACON "R16".   (ENT DAS 3/28/2000)
  H10953/01-- OPR-H355-WH; AWOIS POSITION WAS LOGGED INCORRECTLY. THIS INCORRECT POSITION HAS BEEN EDITED AND CORRECTED (LAT. CORRECTED FROM 24-30-24.0N TO 24-34-24.0N).  EVALUATOR RECOMMENDS NO CHANGE IN CHARTING.  NOTE: THIS VISIBLE WRECK IS LOCATED OUTSIDE THE SURVEY LIMITS FOR SHEET "C" (H10955). (UP 12/3/02, SJV)</td>
