 NM27/70-- BUOY # 2 LOCATION 25 YARDS AT 214 DEG. FROM SUNKEN BARGE.  BUOY # 2 POSITION IS 620 YARDS AT 214 DEG. FROM BUOY #16 - 40-38-52, 74-09-43.  
 CL970/1979--CHART EVALUATION SURVEY, OPR-B408-WH-79, ITEM 16, ITEM IDENTIFIED AS PARTIALLY SUBMERGED WOODEN BARGE IN POSITION 40-38-38, 74-09-54.8.  THE WRECK IS VISIBLE AT HIGH TIDE AND LIES IN 16 FEET OF WATER AT MLW. (ENT DAS 05/01/2000)</td>
