 CL970/1979--CHART EVALUATION SURVEY, OPR-B408-WH-79, ITEM  30, WRECK CLEARLY VISIBLE FROM CHANNEL NEAR BUOY "6" AT POSITON 40-39-29.5N, 74-08-26.2W.  WRECK IS A BARGE ORIENTED SW-NE IN 7.5 FT. OF WATER.  (ENT DAS 05/01/2000)</td>
