<td>  CL347/58--A DIRECTIVE STATING THE U.S.C. & G.S. POLICY TO CHART ALL KNOWN WRECKS CAUSING THIS WRECK TO BE CHARTED AS A NON-DANGEROUS WRECK IN 1958 FROM THE H. O. WRECK LIST.
