<td>  LNM21/76-- VIRGINIA-CHESAPEAKE BAY-YORK RIVER-SURVEY OPERATIONS; THE AMERICAN ARCHAEOLOGY INSTITUTE OF NAUTICAL ARCHAEOLOGY ADVISES THEY ARE CONDUCTING SURVEY OPERATIONS ON A WRECK IN APPROXIMATE POSITION 37-14-04N, LONG. 76-30-07W. A 20-FOOT COFFER DAM EXTENDS 2 TO 3 FEET ABOVE THE SURFACE AND VISIBLE BUOYSWILL BE AT THE SITE. WORK WILL BE IN PROGRESS UNTIL APPROXIMATELY 18 JUNE, 1976. MARINERS ARE REQUESTED TO REDUCE WAKE AND USE EXTREME CAUTION WHEN TRANSITING THE AREA. (ENT 2/2/04, SJV)</td>
