  F00496/04 --MBES DATA WERE ACQUIRED OVER THE ENTIRE 1000 METER SEARCH RADIUS AND THE WRECK WAS NOT LOCATED.  HOWEVER, DUE TO VESSEL SPEED DURING THE SURVEY, THE PING RATE WAS INSUFFICIENT TO DISPROVE THE EXISTENCE OF THE WRECK.  (ENTERED 6/05 BY JCA)-</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
<Point>
<coordinates>-94.250167,28.20025,0.0</coordinates>
</Point>
</Placemark>
