  SOURCE UNKNOWN-- BARGE CHARTED IN 1945 .  APPROX. POS. LAT.38-26-29.69N, LONG.76-25-46.13 W. (ENT 11/17/04, JRS)
  CL1003/74-- NOS TO USPS, DATED 8/6/74; "LETTER OF APPERCIATION" TO MR. JEROME SICK, USPS WHO RECOMMENDS REMOVING "BARGE" FROM CHART AT LAT. 38-26-30N LONG. 76-25-48W.  LETTER STATES HAZARD CAN NOT BE REMOVED WITH OUT OTHER OFFICAL SOURCE.  THE BARGE AND SQUARE SYMBOL IS CHANGED TO AN OBSTRUCTION WITH DOTTED CURVE SYMBOL. (ENT 11/17/04, JRS)</td>
