L-1454/73--914/73; US POWER SQUADRON REPORTS THAT WRECK IS NO LONGER VISIBLE.

  H11416/2006-- OPR-G443-NRT2-05;  Visual search shows no signs of wreck.  The area was to shallow to investigate with SSS.  Recommended to be retained as charted. (Updated CEH 10/2008)</td>
