H12012(2009)--The radium of AWOIS #13003 appears on hydro sheets H12012 and H12014.  The portion of AWOIS #13003 that falls on the H12012 was investigated with Reson 7125 MB.  The AWOIS item was not found.  Due to a change in water depth with the AWOIS radius, full object detection coverage was not acquired.  H12014 has not yet been surveyed as of the end of the 2009 field season.  The AWOIS item has not been disproved, therefore retain as charted. (updated on 8/6/10 by RSM)</td>
