  H11452-- OPR-Y387-NRT4-05; The wreck was located with SSS and VBES.  The least depth of 14 ft was found.  Recommended to revised location to survey position of 41/44/32.675 - 87/30/23.290 and revised least depth to 14 feet.  (updated CEH 9/2008)</td>
