</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>HISTORY</th>
<td> LNM 41/05, CGD08 -- The Oil Rig OCEAN WARWICK has reportedly sunk in the Gulf of Mexico approximately 300 yards off Dauphine Island in approximate position 30-14-54.5N 088-09-26.0W. The sunken rig is reportedly marked with a quick flashing white light on each corner. Mariners are urged to use extreme caution in this area. UPDATED 10/18/2005 JCM.</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
