<td> USCG SAFETY BROADCAST (JAN 2006)- THE U.S. ARMY CORPS OF ENGINEERS HAS VERIFIED THE LOCATION OF THE PREVIOUSLY REPORTED SUBMERGED VESSEL IVO FORT MCHENRY CHAN LB 7, LLN-8255. THE WRECK IS LOCATED APPROX 120 FT WITHIN FORT MCHENRY CHAN IN APPROX POSIT 39-13-31.59 N, 076-32-17.42 W, WITH A MINIMUM DEPTH OF WATER OF 45.7 FT OVER THE WRECK. MARINERS ARE URGED TO USE CAUTION WHEN TRANSITING THE AREA. JEFF MCKEE (PHONE: 410-962-5657) OF THE ACOE REPORTS THAT THE VESSEL HAS NOT BEEN SALVAGED AS OF 24 APRIL 2006. UPDATED 4/24/2006 JCM.</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
