wreck of the Norweigien steamship Volund, which sank in 1908 after colliding with a passenger liner in dense
fog. This DtoN was submitted in the DtoN Letter submitted 01/06/04. Chart 69 Wk with danger curve. UPDATED 8/11/2006 JCM.</td>
