 H7934/51--CS-328; LOCATED WK AT POS.26-45.82N, 82-50.78W IN 95 TO 105 FT.,   
 LL DEPTH OF 7 FT BEFORE LL SLID DOWN TO 100 FT., LL FELT OBJECT FOR 75 TO    
