<th>YEARSUNK</th>
<td></td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>HISTORY</th>
<td>  CL 1062/2006-- NOS, NRT-4;  An uncharted wreck was identified by side scan sonar and developed with single beam echosounder.  The least depth was found to be 9.95 meters with the surrounding area depth of 13 meters.  The least depth was taken at 42°48'24.116"N - 82°28'54.131"W.  (Entered CEH 5/2008)
  H11914-- OPR-W408-NRT4-08, 2008;  The wreck was redevelped during operations for H11915.  A new LD was found to be 9.3 meters, 30 ft.  It is recommended to delete the charted 32 foot dangerous sunken wreck and chart a 30 foot dangerous sunken wreck in the present survey location 42-48-24.0 - 082-28-54.0.  (Updated CEH 2,2010)</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
<Point>
<coordinates>-82.481667,42.806667,0.0</coordinates>
