<td>  H12058/09--OPR-K159-KR-09, NOS: Obstruction is remains of ENSCO 74 rig that was moved during Hurricane Ike.  Position and least depth determined by ROV operated by ENSCO salvage team and position confirmed in survey.  The rig is currently lying upside down on the bottom, with pieces of its legs sticking up towards the surface of the water.  Possibility that wreck will be salvaged and removed in near future.  Evaluator recommends charting as a dangerous obstruction with text "35ft Rep 2009" at 28 34 57.456N 93 43 47.369W. (Entered 12/1/09 KSJ)</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
<Point>
<coordinates>-93.729825,28.582628,0.0</coordinates>
</Point>
</Placemark>
