H12309/2011/NOS: Found by SSS and MBES. While this wreck was assigned as a unique AWOIS item, it lies within the charted fish haven "Triangle Reef" - AWOIS #14905. The least depth on this wreck (13.06 fm) is deeper than the charted authorized minimum of 11 fms.Delete wreck symbol. Delete text "Rep (1988)" in position 36°58'09.670" , -075°21'30.451". (MPG 01/04/2013)</td>
