<td>American Battleship of WWI vintage sunk during Billy Mitchell's aerial bombing experiments in 1923.  Work on these wrecks would support ONMS efforts at expanding the Monitor NMS.  Dimensions and links to wikipedia articles are provided below.  Not sure about water depth but suspect its in the 100-200 meter range.  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/USS_Virginia_%28BB-13%29
USS Virginia: length 441' x beam 76' x draft 24' (Entered on 6/1/11 by RSM).

