07/14/2015-Charted wreck PA (AWOIS 15089) was NOT verified by the field. Search radius was incomplete due to vessel safety. Feature was not completely investigated during present survey operations, so it is not considered disproved. Retain charted dangerous sunken wreck ED, least depth unknown.</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
