<td>H12488/2014 - OPR-B340-TJ-12 -
SAR: A series of wrecks and obstructions that compose an artificial reef (AWOIS 2640) were intended to be located within the charted fish haven to the northwest, but instead lie within these bounds. Recommend to either update the bounds of the fish haven to encompass the obstructions as they exist, or to chart a new area obstruction. The least depth within the area obstruction was verified via object detection multibeam.
Compile: Chart DTON 2.3, Area Obstruction, at the survey position.
(MPG 10/2014)</td>
