<Placemark id="15209">
<name>15209</name>
<snippet> </snippet>
<description><![CDATA[<center><table><tr><th colspan='2' align='center'><em>Attributes</em></th></tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>RECRD</th>
<td>15209</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>VESSLTERMS</th>
<td>UNKNOWN</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>FEATURE_TYPE</th>
<td>Wreck - Submerged, nondangerous</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>LATDEC</th>
<td>40.48225</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>LONDEC</th>
<td>-73.577278</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>GP_QUALITY</th>
<td></td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>DEPTH</th>
<td></td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>SOUNDING_TYPE</th>
<td>Meters and tenths</td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="#E3E3F3">
<th>YEARSUNK</th>
<td></td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>HISTORY</th>
<td>06/25/15

Wreck found with Reson 7125 multibeam. Soundings are corrected to MLLW with
VDATUM solution. This wreck is located about 600 meters from a charted wreck that is not present. Hydrographer recommends to chart wreck.

Cartographically-Rounded Depth (Affected Charts):
69ft (12326_1)
11ft (12300_1, 13006_1, 13003_1)
21.0m (5161_1)

OFFICE NOTES:

SAR: Ensonified with complete coverage MBES. Feature was verified as per survey data and not considered hydrographically significant. The wreck appears to be highly deteriorated with very little vertical relief. Defer the final charting disposition to AHB Compile Team.
COMPILATION: Concur with conditions. Add non-dangerous sunken wreck, least depth 68.89 feet, in the present survey position.

</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
