 1.2 SQ MI AND 18.3 MI OF SNDGS. NO INDICATION OF WK AFTER 2 1/2 HRS OF SEARCH
 ON A FLAT BOTTOM. HYDROGRAPHER RECOMMENDS THAT WK BE DELETED FROM CHART BUT  
