<td>HISTORY
NM20/58--COE; ATLANTA, DANG. SUBM WK, STEEL EXPLORATION VESSEL 60.8FT BY 16.8 
 FT LIES APPROX 150YDS OFFSHORE IN LAT 27-45-12N, LONG 97-06-42W.             
