CL1449/81--COE; F/V, 64 FT L, REMAINS LOCATED IN 6 FT OR WATER AT POSITION    
 38-18-52.7N, 75-05-07.3W. (TELECON BOB EDWARDS, 301-962-3675, SAYS POSITION  
