70-33-16.51W. (ENTERED MSM 4/90)
  196 HISTORICAL MARITIME GROUP OF NEW ENGLAND (LTR DTD 9/9/85); ì
STEEL, 4062 TONS 380FT LONG, BUILT 1906. (UPDATED 7/92 RWD)</td>
