     WITH A LD OF 15 FT. POSITION OBTAINED BY DEL NORTE SHORT RANGE SYSTEM    
     BY HYDROGRAPHIC FIELD PARTY. (H10069/82-83)                              

SURVEY REQUIREMENTS
