 3680 YDS., 020 DEG. FROM ELBOW OF CROSS LEDGE LIGHT. THE WRECK BUOY ON       
 THE THERESA I LOCATED 3900 YDS., 016 DEG. FROM ELBOW OF CROSS LEDGE LIGHT;   
