CL130/80--COE; AUTH. MINIMUM DEPTH 8.25FMS. (ENTERED 9/84 RWD)                
H10151A&B/84-86--OPR-J217-HFP-84; ECHO SOUNDER INVESTIGATION, 100 METER LINE  
