  FE320SS/88--OPR-B660-RU-88; 200% SIDE SCAN SONAR FOR 700M ì
SEARCH RADIUS; LOCAL DIVERS AND FISHERMEN REPORTED THAT THE AREA ì
IS LITTERED WITH WRECKS, MOSTLY BARGES; ONE SIGNIFICANT CONTACT ì
