  FE306/87SS; OPR-E609-RU/HE-87--REQUIRED 200 PERCENT SIDE SCAN SONAR COVERAGE  FOR ASSIGNED 1 NAUTICAL MILE ACCOMPLISHED. HEAVY CONCENTRATIONS OF MARINE LIFE OBSCURED SIDE SCAN SONAR RETURNS. CONSEQUENTLY NUMEROUS INSTANCES  EXISTED WHERE BOTTOM TRACKING WAS LOST AND SONAR GRAMS WERE BLANK. ADDITIONAL WORK NEEDED WHEN UPPER CHESAPEAKE BAY DOES NOT HAVE HIGH CONCENTRATIONS OF FISH. EVALUATOR RECOMMENDS DANGEROUS SUBM WK, PA BE REVISED TO EXISTENCE DOUBTFUL AT CHARTED POSITION LAT 38-35-00N, LONG 76-28-43W. (UPDATE 3/89 GM)</td>
