 DEPTH) AND BOTTOM DRAG CONSTRAINED BY SURF CONDITIONS) AT C.O.'S 
 DISCRETION. 1NM MIN. RADIUS.

OPR-J348-KR-11--DANGEROUS SUNKED WRECK, PA.</td>
