 WRECKAGE; WINCH BARING 10 FT AT MLLW LOCATED AT LAT 57-11-17.8N, LONG        
 156-19-59.46W; THE ENGINE BLOCK BARING 10 FEET AT LAT 57-11-17.7N, LONG      
