  H8423/58--USC&GS WEST COAST FIELD PARTY; LOCATED THE WRECK AS COMPLETELY SUNKEN AND OBTAINED A LEAST DEPTH OF 22 FEET (MLLW) OVER THE WRECK.  (ENTERED 10/96 BY MBH)
