  H11724/07-- HYDROGRAPHER RECOMMENDS RETAINING WRECK AS CHARTED AT LAT. 46/15/56.6N, LONG. 124/02/38.6W, WITH A LEAST DEPTH OF 25 FEET. (ENTERED 9/30/08, EAN)
 
</td>
