  FE486/02--OPR-N438-NRB; LOCATED WRECK AT LAT. 46/15/46.707N, LONG. 124/00/57.763W, WITH A LEAST DEPTH OF 29 FT, USING ECHOSOUNDER HYDROGRAPHY. (UPDATED 3/05 CEH)
