    F00459/00--OPR-N411-NRB: Divers located a barge approximately 60 feet long and 30 feet wide, oriented NW to SE in stable condition.  A mast extends approximately 6 meters above the deck; its least depth was measured by leadline at 2.7 meters/1.5 fathoms (Fix No. 15004).  The depth was corrected to 1.5 meters/0.8 fathoms at MLLW based on preliminary real tides. Chart the submerged wreck (.8 WK) at latitude 48:31:44.138N, longitude 123:00:04.530W</td>
