 NM 23/86--  Add dangerous wreck PA at 57/24/32.5N, 135/37/18.0W.  (ENT DAS 02/15/2002)

 H11109/02 -- OPR-O12-RA-02; INTACT WRECK FOUND IN POSITION 57-24-31.81 N, 135-37-20.60 W (NAD83) WITH A LEAST DEPTH OF 44.965 METERS. UPDATED 1/20/2006 JCM.</td>
