<td>  BP67066/64 -- U.S. Army Corps of Engineers blueprint indicates a sunken barge located at 45/43/31.8N, 122/46/02.0W (NAD83, scaled from chart 18525).  (Entered 9/02 by CG)
  F00488-- 2002-2003 (OPR-N438-NRB);  AN OBSTRUCTION WAS OBSERVED ON THE SONARGRAM AND A VISUEL SEARCH AT THE AWOIS POSITION CONFIRMED A DETERIORATED WRECK. THE WRECK WAS EXPOSED 7 FT AT THE LOCATION 45/43/31/83N - 122/46/01.55W. (UPDATED CEH 6/05)
  H11858/08--(OPR-N338-KR-08); Wreck found approximately 70 meters to the northeast of a charted wreck (AWOIS 53025)</td>
