</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>HISTORY</th>
<td>  CL1744/71 -- USPS chart correction letter indicates that a wrecked barge was located at 45/37/07N, 122/47/50W (NAD27).
  Wreck changed from visible to submerged between 1976 and 1977 editions of chart.  Reference could not be found after exhaustive search.  (Entered 9/02 by CG)
  F00488-- 2002-2003 (OPR-N438-NRB);  NOT INVESTIGATED, AN ATTEMPT WAS MADE WITH SSS, BUT DEPTHS TOO SHALLOW.  RETAINED AS CHARTED.  (UPDATED CEH 6/05)
 H11859/08-- The area inside the AWOIS radius was covered by multibeam up to the 2m curve. No significant features were detected. The wreck is charted inshore of the survey coverage area.</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
