<td>    H11293, 2004; Wreck not visually observed. Submerged wreck verified with SWMB in location 47°39'25.453"N,
122°12'32.665"W. (KRW 06/12/2007)  

CL-1341/1982, 11/17/82; USPS REPORTS THE EXISTANCE OF A DANGEROUS VISIBLE WRECK OF A BURNED FERRY, ON THE SOUTH SIDE OF THE PROMIENT DOCK, IN LAT. 47/39/25N. LON. 122/12/28 W.(NAD27). A PORTION OF THE HULL IS VISIBLE. THE PROMINENT DOCK SHOWN IS IN DISREPAIR AND NOT PROMINENT FOR THE LAST 100FT OF LENGTH. (ENTERED 12/03 BY KRW).</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
