  H11642-- OPR-N411-NRT3-07;  Submerged wreckage with a least depth of 53ft was found within the AWOIS search radius.  The surrounding area is littered with wreckage and other submerged debris.  This item is partially covered by a barge which serves as a breakwater for Tyee Marina.  It is recommended to not chart the 53 wreck since there is a shoaler wreck in the vicinity of the 53 wreck.  Also recommmended to delete 48 wreck and danger curve.</td>
