F00513, S-L920-NRT6-05; Search conducted for charted wreck, wreck not found in charted position. However, numerous other wreckage was located in this anchorage that may correspond to AWOIS item. The Hydrographer recommends removing the charted wreck at this position. The Hydrographer recommends denoting area outlined in descriptive report with "Numerous sunken wrecks and obstructions". All wreckage and obstructions that fall within this warning are marked with keyword "Anchorage A-8". Please see the Chart Comparison section of the Descriptive Report for a detailed discussion of Anchorage A-8. (Updated 10/1/09 KAK)     </td>
