<td></td>
</tr><tr bgcolor="">
<th>HISTORY</th>
<td>H11127 -- 113 meter gap in MBES coverage in an area of no LIDAR coverage.  No soundings were available in this area, however survey soundings on either side of the gap suggest the outcropping has a LD of no less than 23 meters.  The area was recommended for charting at 12 fms by hydrographer and PHB cartographer.  The hydrographer further recommends that the area be added to AWOIS database for full MBES coverages when field units return to the area.  (Added by LAh 10/5/2009)</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
