<th>HISTORY</th>
<td>H11551(2007)--HP of sunken sail boat with pole containing streamer tape on top found at survey position: 47° 22' 20.2" N, 122° 27' 22.9" W.  Wreck is visible with a least depth of 4.33m above MLLW. Branch recommends 'Do not chart wreck. Chart obstruction area and seaward most wreck'.  Entered by RES on 5/4/10.</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
