<td>  F00612-- A submerged wreck with least depth of 8.9 feet located near a dock within Brooklyn Basin. Wreck length is 7.5 meters, beam is 2.6 meters, height from bottom is one meter. One third of the wreck rests underneath the dock. The shoalest depth of 8.9 feet represents the portion of the wreck that is
