FT. SOUNDING.
  CL338/43--CGS; POLICY MEMO STATING THAT ALL SOUNDINGS CHARTED ì
FROM SPECIFIC WIRE DRAG SHEETS NOW BE CHARTED AS CLEARED DEPTHS ì
WITH BASKETS AND APPROPRIATE NOTATIONS; 44 FT. SOUNDING REVISED TO ì
