<td>  BP41339/34--VISIBLE WRECK LOCATED BY AIR PHOTO COMPILATION  UPDATED TO 1946.
  
  CL398/48--CPR; WRECK NO LONGER VISIBLE; REVISED TO SUBMERGED.
  
  H9995/83--OPR-J217-HSB-81; ITEM 311; FOUND ON MAIN SCHEME.  HYDROGRAPHY IN LAT 30-19-48.01, LONG 87-18-51.70W. LD OF  1.0 FOOT BY SOUNDING POLE. EVALUATOR RECOMMENDS CHARTING A WRECK  COVERED 1 FOOT AS SURVEYED AND DELETING PRESENTLY CHARTED  DANGEROUS SUBM WRECK. (ENTERED 2/3/89 SJV)

H12061/2009; NOS -- Survey confirmed wreck in shallow water with visual search (currently not charted).  However, reviewer recommends nearby foul area (AWOIS #7093) enlarged to include AWOIS items #7094 and #12465.  Foul area should be retained and limits revised to incorporate these two items. (3/15/12 KSJ)</td>
