PNEUMATIC DEPTH GAUGE LEAST DEPTH, ONLY ENGINE BLOCK AND ì
DETERIORATED REMAINS RISING NO MORE THAN 3FT OFF THE BOTTOM ì
EXISTS, POSITION GIVEN IN LAT 41-28-23.31N, LONG  ì
70-49-48.94W(NAD83). (UPDATED 8/95 RWD)
  OPR-B904-TJ-04--The feature is AWOIS item #7243, imaged by RESON 8125 MBES and KLEIN 5000 side scan sonar. This item is an old wreck that is highly scattered and almost completely disintegrated. The shoalest point of this feature is approximately 1m above the water bottom; retain wreck as charted (RES 12/10/07).</td>
