ECHO SOUNDER DEPTH IS 3 FEET DEEPER THAN PRIOR SURVEY DEPTH. ì
EVALUATOR RECOMMENDS RETAINING 59-FOOT WRECK IN PRESENT SURVEY ì
POSITION OF LAT. 38-53-54.315N, LONG. 76-24-04.650W. (UP 3/31/98, ì
SJV)
