H12525 - 45ft Wreck verified with MB and SS data. This feature is one of two wrecks located within the radius of AWOIS 7811 approximately 169m apart. This feature is located approximately 55m north of the fish haven limits. Wreck appears to be a barge. This wreck could be the barge associated with AWOIS 7795 reather than AWOIS 7811. It is recommended this item is not charted due to its close proximity to the charted fish haven to the south and the wreck found to the north west. No changes to charting recommended. </td>
