  HOMELAND SECURITY PROJECT REPORT-- S-E604-WH-02; ITEM LOCATED DURING MAIN SCHEME SIDE SCAN SONR OPERATIONS. IMAGERY INDICATED A WRECK. SWMB OBTAINED A LD OF 42 FEET IN LAT. 37-01-13.47N, LONG. 76-30-24.91W. EVALUATOR RECOMMENDS DELETING CHARTED WIRE DRAG SYMBOL AND CHARTING A 42 WK AS SURVEYED. (ENT 6/23/04, SJV)</td>
