APPROX. POS. LAT.37-02-00N, LONG.76-07-00W. PRESENTLY CHARTED AS SUBM. DANG.
WK. PA (CHART 12222, 29TH ED.).
ASSIGNED TO OPR-515-RU/HE-77; ITEM 1D; NOT INVEST. (ENTERED, 9/16/83, MJF)
