(IE. WRECKS WERE NOT VISIBLE ON PHOTOS). (ENT 4/12/95, SJV)
  H10622/95-- OPR-E346-AHP; WRECKS LOCATED BY FATHOMETER. ì
HYDROGRAPHER RECOMMENDS DELETING CHARTED SUBMERGED WRECKS AND ì
