TRIM AND LETTERING ON BOW. 13.4 X 4.56 METERS (44 X 15 FEET). NO ì
APPARENT HULL DAMAGE. MAIN SAIL AND JIB COVERING FORWARD END OF ì
VESSEL. EVALUATOR RECOMMENDS CHARTING 18 WK "QUEST" AS SURVEYED ì
(ENT 6/21/96, SJV)
</td>
