<th>HISTORY</th>
<td>  L-302/72 -- APPLICATION (DATED FEB 17, 1972) TO CONSTRUCT ARTIFICIAL REEF / FISH HAVEN, WITH AN AUTHORIZED MINIMUM DEPTH OF 30 FT, 4.5 NMI SEAWARD OF LOCKWOODS FOLLY INLET AT 35-50-00 N, 78-13-00 W (NAD 83). CENTER OF REEF IS NOW CHARTED IN POSITION: LAT 33-50-00 N, LONG 78-12-42 W (NAD83). [UPDATED 3/25/2005 JCM}

  H10700/96 --  TWO WRECKS (AWOIS ITEMS 13015 AND 13016) WERE LOCATED WITHIN THE FISH HAVEN WITH DEPTHS LESS THAN THE AUTHORIZED MIN DEPTH OF 30 FT.  (ENTERED 1/97 RWD)  (UPDATED 3/98 RWD)</td>
</tr></table></center>]]></description>
